window.products.push({"id":626068,"name":"Lekue Gourmet Round Ice Cube, Tray Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414ATWCWqbL._AC_.jpg","description":"In time, most ice cube trays will break. We all know this. It happens because ice cube trays are made, traditionally, with plastic. Plastic gets less flexible in colder temperatures. Each time we twist them to release our ice they get weaker. Eventually most ice cube trays will (snap.) Break. But what if our ice cube trays were made of rubber? Then they would be more durable and flexible and we wouldn’t have to strain ourselves or our trays for ice. What if they were also made of … recyclable rubber? Tough and easy to use. Question no more. Lekue has done it. Experience lekue ice cube trays in attractive blue rubber. The round ice cubes will add a touch of class to soda or cocktails.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414ATWCWqbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lekue","source_asin":"B001CDB878","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001CDB878","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001CDB878","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
