window.products.push({"id":626070,"name":"PrintFactory Canvases Vintage Pride Flag Premium Banksy Graffiti Wall Canvas Art Print for Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yo1frdzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GICLEE PRINT ON ARCHIVABLE CANVAS AND FRAME OVERVIEW Celebrate your pride, travel experiences, or future travel destinations in your office, home or wherever you please! bring color and light to your interior decor with these vintage flags! All portraits are restored and digitally enhanced to remove dust and flaws while maintaining the integrity of the original portrait. CANVAS DESCRIPTION: The canvas used for printing is a bright white, semigloss coated poly-cotton blend suited for fine art reproduction. Features include: Archival lifespan of over 100 years. It is a heavy weight (340 gsm) with an Oxford 2 over 1 weave. It is acid free, pH neutral and has a high white point for consistent and accurate colors. INK DESCRIPTION: We use Epson certified inks (not third party compatible inks). This ensures that the colors are accurate and consistent and will not fade over time. The rated life span of the inks will match that of the canvas (100 years). Epson inks provide a larger color gamut than competing ink technologies to allow for richer and more vibrant prints. STRETCHER FRAME: The wood used is kiln dried pine. It will not warp or bow over time. The edges are beveled and rounded to minimize contact with the canvas fabric (prevents acid damage over time). Each frame is carefully checked to ensure it is flat and will be flush against the wall after hanging. PRODUCTION: Each canvas is carefully hand stretched. The canvas fabric is stapled to the back of the stretcher frame so the staples will not be visible. The corners are carefully folded to minimize the visible bulge. ORIGIN: The canvas is printed and stretched in the USA. Additionally, our suppliers for the unprinted canvas rolls, stretcher frame wood, and OEM inks are domestic as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yo1frdzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PrintFactory","source_asin":"B07FXDRPF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FXDRPF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FXDRPF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
