window.products.push({"id":626270,"name":"Stuffed Animal Storage Bean Bag Cover, 37Inch Large Size Organization Velvet Extra Soft Stuffie Seat with 31Inch Double Head Zipper for Kids Toys Blan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YCXLDQ0kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Perfect gift for children's day,Treasure up your child's best memories! For many little kids, stuffed animals toys always be the best friend who accompany them grow up, and these would become their precious memories. As children’s stuffed animals can easily take over their bed, bedroom, and playroom, parents alway get tired of cleaning up. Now,you find a solution on how to put away your child’s stuffed animal in a useful way and keep your child's best memories! It is a durable and comfortable bag, which can be full of many stuffed animals toys. Designed especially for your needs, saving space, clean up your almost all house items to avoid messing. MORE DURABLE High quality thicker velvet fabrics, durable double metal pull heads zipper and reinforced stitching, braving everything from your children's energetic play to the occasional spill,support they drag them all over the house and sit, stand, lay and flop all over them. Easy to use and clean, machine washable. EASY STORAGE Our stuffed animal bean bags are designed with 31'' long zipper,double zipper heads, it is easy for you to stuff with all your stuffed animals, blankets, and towels, bed sheets, Etc. EXTRA SOFT Luxury velvet, comfortable to the touch, feels like pet's plush,soft and tender without harm to skin.When the bag getting full,it looks like adding a bean bag chair on the room and the kids can really stretch out and relax on it. Sitting on it with a good book,now enjoy your story time. Tips: This pruduct is a stuffed animal storage bag, stuffed animal and filler do not included. If you just want to use this storage bag as a bean bag, please add in stuffed animal, clothes, blankets, towels or bean bag filler by yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YCXLDQ0kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Benochan","source_asin":"B07KD88HCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KD88HCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KD88HCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
