window.products.push({"id":626286,"name":"JOINAS Milk Frother Handheld Battery Operated Foam Maker (Batteries Not Included), with Double Whisks & Cover Stand, Stainless Steel Hand Frother for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N-6UOrpCL._AC_.jpg","description":"BARISTA-GRADE QUALITY - This pro-calibre milk frother packs plenty of power and is constructed of premium materials for performance and durability. The whisk rod is made of sturdy food-approved 304 stainless steel with the optimal thickness for smooth and efficient operation. DOUBLE SPRING HEAD WHISKS - With a replaceable double spring head whisk can froth a LARGE amount of HOT milk! You will always have one available while the other one is undergoing wash, way easier to impress friends & family! QUICKLY CREATE PERFECT MILK FOAM - The handheld milk frother up to 19000RPM, within 15-20 seconds, this electric foam maker will give you rich and thick froth to enjoy hot drinks like Cappuccino, latte, milkshake, matcha, hot chocolates.It is also perfect for egg whites, cocktails, smoothies, etc. EASY TO USE AND CLEAN - Install 2AA batteries (not included) before you start. Simply press the button on the top once, the item starts working. Put it into a container with liquid food up to approx 1/3 to froth. Whip for 15-20 seconds (longer for non-dairy milk). Washing the mixer is just as easy: just rinse is gently under water and dry it with a towel and it is as good as new. PERFECT GIFT - The milk frother provides a rich creamy foam, just like a professional barista. It is definitely a magnificent gift for your friends and family. Enjoy the elegance, simplicity and flavor of a rich bubble drink anytime, anywhere. We offer 100% Money Back Guarantee if you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, if there're any questions, we are here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N-6UOrpCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOINAS","source_asin":"B09PGJ9MD3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PGJ9MD3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PGJ9MD3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
