window.products.push({"id":626319,"name":"2-Pack Reusable Bubble Tea Cup Set – 21oz Diamond-Pattern Glass Boba Tea Cups with Lids & Straws – Bubble Tea Gift Set Includes Recipe Book & Stickers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VoC-32ECS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Most Complete Bubble Tea Set - If you’re searching for the ultimate Bubble Tea experience, look no further! Designed by true Boba-Holics, this set is a dream come true for any Bubble Tea super-fan. Each set includes 22 oz glass bubble tea cups with lids, plastic storage lids, stainless steel straws, plastic straws, recipe book, sticker sheets, gift-ready package and straw brush. Made from Durable Materials - Unlike many boba cups, these reusable glass cups and lids are sturdy enough for the dishwasher. Thick lids are fully leak-proof and this whole set is built-to-last. Easy, reusable, and custom-designed set especially for Bubble Tea! Customize Your Cup with Stickers - Make your everyday Bubble Tea Cup even more eye-catching with bright, beautiful stickers. Choose from 21 cute, illustrated animal friends. They’re sure to bring a smile to your face every time you grab your glass! Adorable Recipe Book Included - This bubble tea cup set really has it all! Now you can try your hand at tasty, fresh, home-made boba recipes thanks to this 26-page Bubble Tea Recipe Book. With vibrant colors, charming illustrations, and a variety of recipes, this book is sure to be a hit in your house! Reusable & Environmentally-Friendly: Do your part to save the environment with this sleek, sturdy, eco-friendly tumbler. Toss fewer cups in the trash and tote your trusty tumbler instead. Why not try this set for 30-days? If you’re not happy you can return for a refund. So, let’s go! Get your everyday bubble tea cups today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VoC-32ECS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAND BASICS","source_asin":"B08THY97CZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THY97CZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THY97CZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626320,"name":"Cilio Stainless Decanter Drying Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r6YBA1wFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Stainless steel stand safely and thoroughly dries crystal wine decanters as well as vases or plastic bags. Keeps the decanter free of water spots for a dazzling sparkle. Amazon.com Perfect for delicate decanters or slender vases, this drying rack from Cilio is handy, simple, and effective. The durable piece is made from stainless steel with a stable base and a sturdy central pole. To dry vases, decanters, and other narrow-necked items, just invert them and balance them on the rubber foot. Drying glassware this way minimizes water spots, and protects mouth edges that can get nicked in a dish drainer. The piece also comes in handy with plastic bags, which can be propped open around the base. A mirror finish makes the rack sleek and shiny, and the minimalist design allows for a variety of storage solutions. The triangular base is 7 inches in diameter, and the stand is 13 inches high. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r6YBA1wFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cilio","source_asin":"B00006RGLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006RGLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006RGLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626321,"name":"Wishstream Tea Ball Infuser, 2 Packs Stainless Steel Tea Strainer with Spoon and Drip Trays, Extra Fine Mesh Tea Filter with Extented Chain Hook for L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+kh7xI4NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Quality] The cooking infuser is made of high quality 304 stainless steel, no special smell and without any harmful chemicals. The high-quality tea strainer will allow the tea leaves to fully expand and breathe during the brewing process, and give you a flavorful cup of tea every time. [Fine Mesh Design] The fine mesh is evenly distributed, small holes allows the water to move through the tea leaves and prevent the leaves escaping so that none of the stray bits will float around your cup or teapot when in the process of brewing. A definite must-have for tea lovers. [Versatile and Convenient] Our reusable stainless steel tea balls with a 4.7 inches extented chain hook , whether it is making tea in a cup or boiling soup in a pot, it is very convenient to take out. Package comes with two mini dish saucer for the tea filter to rest on. The spoon can help you take out your loose tea leaf for avoiding making a mess. [A Great Gift Item] Our tea steeper diffuser set comes in a box. Each tea strainer set includes 2 loose leaf tea infuser, 1 spoon and 2 drip trays. It a great choice for a wedding gift, housewarming gift or any other kind of gift. [Wide Usage]The tea strainer are ideal for all types of tea leaves, such as black tea, green tea, rose tea, jasmine tea, etc. It is also applicable for your own customized herbs, spices, juices etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+kh7xI4NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wishstream","source_asin":"B08YRQ2TYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YRQ2TYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YRQ2TYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
