window.products.push({"id":626360,"name":"Walter 4783 Teflon 6-2/7-Inch (16 cm) Chef's Knife with Black Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41czv5o13dL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"One of the most popular of all the kitchen knives, the chef's knife offers both professional and novice chefs excellent versatility, safety, and convenience. This 6-2/7-inch (16 cm) chef's knife by Walter is no exception. The knife's long blade and pointed tip make it easy to slice, dice, mince, and chop anything from onions and carrots for a soup to green peppers and pineapple for a homemade pizza. Even more, when turned on its side, the knife's wide, flat blade surface allows for transporting food from the cutting board to its next destination. As part of Walter's Teflon series, the knife features molybdenum-vanadium steel made with the proper hardness of 56 degrees to ensure a long-lasting cutting edge. Even more, the steel blade comes coated in Teflon for a nonstick finish that allows food to effortlessly fall away, which means more efficient chopping. The Teflon coating also creates a harder surface and makes the knife more resistant to chemicals, corrosion, and everyday wear and tear. Another thoughtful detail includes the knife's ergonomically shaped handle, which offers a secure grip and comes triple-riveted for strength. Made in Spain, the knife measures approximately 12-1/2 by 2-4/5 by 1-1/5 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41czv5o13dL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walter","source_asin":"B0042VJL1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0042VJL1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0042VJL1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
