window.products.push({"id":626437,"name":"CareUAll Hot Air Popcorn Maker, Upgraded Oil-free Pop Corn Popper, 1400W Max Hot Air Popper Popcorn Machine with Removable Lid and Measuring Spoon, Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MEwoG7KRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast, Delicious & All Natural: Add 1 spoon of FRESH DRY CORN KERNELS into the hot air popper, put the lid and measuring spoon on, and switch on the unit. Your perfect snack for a movie night will be ready in 2.5 minutes. The popcorn maker pops kernels evenly with hot swirling airflow instead of oil, quickly creating a low-calorie treat with no saturated fat, additives, added salt or preservatives. It's a truly ideal corn popper for health-conscious people Upgraded Performance: The hot air corn popper has a downward spout that directs popcorn right into the container. No popcorn or kernels fly over in the kitchen. The lid with heat emission holes and the measuring cup which doubles as a butter melter, both made of food-grade BPA-free material, are reliably heat resistant. Hot-air-swirling technology ensures even heating and high popping rate and also minimizes waste of kernels. Anti-slip design of the base guarantees stability during popping Food-Grade Materials: Food safety is always the top priority. This popcorn machine's casing, lid and measuring spoon/butter melter are made of BPA-free heat-resisting plastic, safe for cooking corns or melting butter, chocolate or other seasoners. The popping chamber with nonstick liner is made of food-grade quality aluminum which heats up fast. CAUTION: The transparent cover will be hot during use. Please be careful and don't get burnt Overheat Protection & Hassle-Free Cleanup: The hot air popcorn popper stops automatically when overheated. Just wait for a while for it to cool down and then continue the popping. No oil, no grease and no flying popcorn or kernels, there is not much cleaning work after each use. Just relax and enjoy the snack and a happy family movie night Aftersales Services: The product has been tested and certified in accordance with strict standards and it's covered by all-round customer services. If you are not satisfied with the purchase, please don't hesitate to contact us. We are always at your service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MEwoG7KRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CareUAll","source_asin":"B08TC44WV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TC44WV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TC44WV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
