window.products.push({"id":626445,"name":"Traditional Thanksgiving Foam Soap Bottle - Black (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MklISSigL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some fun to your soap dispensing with one of our foaming soap dispensers! These soap dispenser pumps, when personalized, will add a charming touch of personality and color to your space! They will look lovely on the side of any kitchen or bathroom sinks. Customize some for your home, or pair with a few other home goods products as a thoughtful housewarming gift!This soap dispenser is made of a robust plastic and has a clear base. The included soap pump is available in black or white color. This dispenser is 6.5 inches tall, 3 inches wide, and 2 inches deep. We display your customized designs on the front and back sides of these foaming hand soap dispensers.To fill your bathroom soap dispenser, we suggest filling it with foaming soap or filling one-quarter of the bottle with soap, and then the remaining space with water to allow the nozzle to create the foaming effect. To pump, follow the \"open\" curved arrow on the nozzle to line the nozzle up with the indentation at the base of the nozzle.Design Shown: Traditional Thanksgiving (#513196)Features:==================================== * Made from robust, clear plastic * Foaming soap nozzle available in black or white * 6.5\" X 3\" X 2\" * Customization displayed on front and back * Made for you in the USAUsage Instructions:==================================== * Fill with foaming soap * Or fill a quarter of the bottle with normal soap and the remaining with water * Follow “open” curved arrow on nozzle to pump * Line up nozzle with indentation on the base of the nozzle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MklISSigL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B017V5MSTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017V5MSTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017V5MSTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626446,"name":"Walensee Boho Knitted Throw Blanket, Brown 50\" x 60\" Soft, Shaggy and Warm Microfiber Mexcian, Aztec, Native American,Western Blanket for Couch, Sofa,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911lrbrliCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Material: Made of premium microfiber feather yarn with high fiber density and large surface area, providing a warmer and cozier experience. The warm and cozy throw offers a soft, stretchy, lightweight, durable, and stylish experience. The Unique design of this throw blanket adds a unique touch to any room's decor. The contrasting colors create a striking look, making it a perfect accessory for those looking to add a touch of personality to their home or outdoor space. Multiple Usage: Walensee throw has four unique styles, different colors, hand-woven design is perfect for gifting on occasions like birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, and Thanksgiving.This cozy blanket is versatile and perfect for all seasons, suitable for use as a decorative throw on couches, sofas, chairs, and beds. It can also be used as a quilt replacement, making it an ideal accessory for relaxing at home, traveling outdoors, watching TV, or reading. Machine Washable: The throw blanket is not only stylish and versatile, but it's also easy to maintain. This machine-washable blanket can be conveniently washed separately in cold water and tumble dried on low heat. With its durable construction, it can withstand frequent washing without fading, deforming, wrinkling, or pilling. The feature makes it a perfect accessory for families with kids or pets or individuals who want a low-maintenance option for their home decor or outdoor activities. Tips: Please note that our throw blanket is vacuum-packed for shipping. Upon receiving your blanket, we recommend unpacking it and laying it flat for about 24 hours to restore its thickness and fluffiness. This will ensure that you can fully enjoy the softness and warmth of your new blanket. Value Every Customer: Walensee are committed to providing 100% customer satisfaction. If you have any questions or concerns about our blanket, please do not hesitate to contact us. We are always here to help and provide you with an instant and satisfactory solution. We stand behind our products with a 100% satisfaction guarantee and strive to offer exceptional customer service to ensure that every customer has a positive shopping experience. Thanks for choosing Walensee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911lrbrliCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walensee","source_asin":"B0BVFTWSFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVFTWSFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVFTWSFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
