window.products.push({"id":626456,"name":"KOCWELL Ziplock Bag Organizer and Plastic Wrap Dispenser with Cutter, 6 In 1 Bamboo Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Ziplock Bag St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GjE5Xq7qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bamboo 👍【6 in 1 Kitchen Organization 】The product combines the functions of sealed bag storage and a plastic wrap cutter. This food bag organizer contains 4 ziplock bag organizers ＆ 2 foil and plastic wrap organizers. Keep your plastic wrap and food storage bags neat and organized with this bamboo box. Very beautiful and practical kitchen organization. 👍【4 Ziplock Bag Organizer for Drawer】This food storage bag organizer has 4 compartments, basically compatible with all types of kitchen Ziplock bags, contains Gallon, Quart, Snack, Sandwich. Just put the ziplock bag into the Bamboo storage box according to the label display. Complete spacing and opening bumps make the bag less likely to drop and not get mixed up. 👍【2 Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer with Cutters】Compatible with the most brand of plastic wrap, aluminum foil, and wax paper. After placing the material into the foil dispenser with cutters, the opening in the middle makes it easy to find the starting line for rolling. Pull the material and slide the cutting knife to cut, More simple convenient. Note: Not compatible with rolls that are wider than 12\" x 2.2\". 👍【ECO & DURABLE Bamboo】The Ziplock Bag Organizer is made of premium bamboo to ensure there are no cracks or broken pieces. Well-constructed quality and excellent craftsmanship make it more solid and durable to last for years. Each bamboo dispenser has a unique natural texture, which is earth-friendly. And complements the kitchen design. You can put it in a drawer, on the counter top or hang it on the wall. 👍【No Assembling Required & Easy Identification】The ziplock bag organizer is equipped with stylish engraved wrap names in every slot dispenser to help you effortlessly identify the contents. Our aluminum foil dispenser comes fully assembled, 1 piece box with 2 slots ＆ 4 storage bag organizers, offering you different ways of organizing plastic wraps. ( Please measure the size of your wraps rolls and kitchen drawer before ordering to make sure that our foil organizer with sliding cutter will fit.) 👍 To avoid damage to the cutting strip of plastic wrap, we are equipped with 4 cutting strips. So you can replace it at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GjE5Xq7qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOCWELL","source_asin":"B0B1ZLVFKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1ZLVFKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1ZLVFKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
