window.products.push({"id":626607,"name":"100% Organic Cotton Throw Blanket for Couch Sofa, 4-Layer Muslin Pre-Washed Plant Dyed Cotton, Breathable Soft, Cozy Warm Lightweight Blanket for Adul","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913TfzGgXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 Layers Soft 100% Pre-washed Plant Dyed Organics Cotton, Okeo-tex Type 2 Certified A \"MUST-HAVE\" item in your Holiday Shopping Book. Four Layers of Softness: Our throw blanket features four layers of ultra-soft, organic muslin cotton, providing a plush and comfortable feel that you won't be able to resist. LIGHTWEIGHT THROW BLANKETS: Perfect for year-round use, our muslin cotton throw is lightweight and breathable, ensuring you stay comfortable and cozy without feeling weighed down MOISTURE ABSORPTION: Made up of 100% Organic Muslin Cotton to ensure they are Soft and Breathable. This ensures that you get the desired warmth without adding too much of weight and suffocation. Handcrafted and Unique: This throw is about 55x60 inches. Each throw blanket is hand-dyed using traditional techniques, giving it a one-of-a-kind, artisanal feel that will add character and charm to any room Versatile and Stylish: With its beautiful, natural hues and elegant design, our throw blanket is a versatile and stylish addition to any home decor, whether draped over a sofa, bed, or armchair. Easy Care: Washes up nicely and comes out even softer each time. MACHINE WASHABLE, use non-chlorine bleach if needed, and Tumble Dry Low. It's so easy to care for and maintain, so you can enjoy it for years to come","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913TfzGgXaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KyraHome","source_asin":"B07D2DQGKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2DQGKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2DQGKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626608,"name":"Hallmark Video Game Controller Christmas Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6178+sffnxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Got a gamer in your house? Whether or not they have the coveted video game chair or hold the points record, they'll appreciate the cool factor of this Christmas tree ornament. With its graphic design and \"Game On!\" message, it's perfect for the tween or teen in your house. Made of resin, this Hallmark Ornament measures 2.77 x 2.18 x 1.28 inches. The ornament is ready to hang on your Christmas tree with a hanger attachment. Great Christmas gift idea for family and friends who are also gamers. Hallmark Ornaments are a great way to commemorate hobbies, life events and individual interests. Each festive and collectible ornament is perfect for sharing with family and friends. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, Christmas tree ornaments, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6178+sffnxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark","source_asin":"B0BL9VL3MH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL9VL3MH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL9VL3MH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626609,"name":"FASTNOVA 8x12 inch Brown Real Solid Wood Picture Photo Poster Print Art Frame Made to Display Picture 6x8 with Mat or 8x12 Without Mat, Table Top and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o2dyhUo8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"1. The two sides of acrylic sheet are covered with protective film, Please all torn off when use! 2. Wall Mounting Material Included: Black S hook and White non-trace nail . 3. The black S hook : It has been installed on the back of the picture frame. When Hanging the picture frame. Break open the sawtooth iron of the balck S hook to 45 degrees with your hand , to be able to hook the protruding tail of the white non-trace nail conveniently. 4. The white non-trace nail : It is in the extra small plastic bag. It has three thin needles and one protuberant tail. The needle must point to the metope, pay attention to direction and safety . The three thin needles were nailed to the wall without a trace, which was easy and firm. The protruding tail is used to hook the black S hook on the back of the picture frame, conveniently and quickly. 5.The frame is 2 cm Wide 2 cm Thick, 9 x 13 inch is the outside dimension of the photo frame, not the dimension of the photo. 6. 8 x 12 inch is the dimension of the photo that can be displayed without mat. Photos that are larger than or less than 8 x 12 inch can not be used without mat on the print frame. 7. Because the dimension of the accurate opening of the mat is (5+3/8) x (7+3/8), the display dimension of any size picture on the poster frame is (5+3/8) x (7+3/8), which is about 6 x 8. So 6 x 8 inch is the minimum dimension of the photo that can be displayed with mat. 8. The unmarked nail can not be used on hard walls such as tile and marble.if you want to use, please use electric drill and screw. 9. Can be used for matting photos, art, and needlepoint. 10. Great for crafts, backboards, signs, children's projects, company and school projects. 11. Good art frames Solutions at gallery. 12. Have 3-5 mm size measurement error, please careful purchase if particularly mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o2dyhUo8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASTNOVA","source_asin":"B0725T3BR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0725T3BR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0725T3BR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
