window.products.push({"id":626743,"name":"PHINOX Under Sink Organizers and Storage, Bathroom Cabinet Organizer and Storage, 2 Tier Under Cabinet Organizers and Storage with 4 Hooks, Reinforced","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j4iIIZWOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍[Complete Metal Structure] This under sink organizer is completely made of sturdy metal with anti-rust painting, unique reinforced thickened design of the 4 support tubes which permits a more than 80lbs loading capacity and stronger stability. 👍[Tool-free & 2-Minute Assembly] Compared with other metal bathroom organizers, all you need to do is just connect 4 metal tubes and 2 baskets with a couple of screws, and the whole installation takes less than 2 mins. Assembled size:12.51''L x 8.46'' W x 13.77'' H 👍[Maximize Storage Space] The under the sink organizer has 2-layer design to maximize the use of space. In addition, the extra 4 hooks for hanging bath ball, towels which provide more storage possibilities. 👍[Multi-use] This under sink organizer fits perfectly the bathroom and kitchen under sinks, cabinets, countertops, food pantries, offices, and more. Modern and stylish minimalist design can be integrated into most household styles perfectly and keep your items organized. 👍[Easy to Clean & Stackable Organization] The hollow design of our bathroom storage organizer drawer is great for drainage; just flush with water to clean it. When not in use, disassemble it and put all the parts into the bottom drawer for organization and space-saving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j4iIIZWOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHINOX","source_asin":"B0BHSHM56D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSHM56D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSHM56D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626744,"name":"Sacramento California Skyline by Michael Tompsett, White Matte, Black Frame 11x14-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EFYu4nkEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a colorful watercolor skyline of Sacramento, California. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. An 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in an 11x14 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EFYu4nkEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01LYKS165","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYKS165","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYKS165","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626745,"name":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner 450W Stick Vacuum Cleaner with 33000pa Powerful Suction,60mins Runtime,Lightweight Handheld Vacuum with LED Display,5-Stage Fi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rJWWENaNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️ 【TANGLE-FREE BRUSH ROLL】S11 Roll-Clean cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with horizontally opposed blades, which could cut off the hair that is entangled in the brush when the vacuum start to work.and it also could effectively prevents tangling of hair and loss of suction power due to clogging the filter. ☑️【33000Pa POWERFUL SUCTION】450 W integrated electric motor, which offers the resulting suction power up to the level 33000pa. The engine has 12500 rpm and thanks to the high power,andthe air flow is ensured at the level of up to 1000 liters per minute.You can choose from three modes Eco / Standard / Turbo (10KPa / 15 KPa / 33 KPa). ☑️【60min LONG RUNTIME】The S11 cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with 7*2500mAh lithium battery packs.which can provides 60-minutes of non-stop cleaning in Eco mode.It adopts a one-button disassembly design,which can be replaced at any time. The daily cleaning of large houses can also be done easily. ☑️【INTELLIGENT REAL-TIME DISPLAY】Understanding vacuum status including suction power, battery whenever you clean. Real-time display of suction through the ring, real-time percentage display of remaining power and timely reminders of obstructions, orderly planning and cleaning. ☑️【5-STAGE FILTRATION】5-stage fully sealed filtration system captures fine particles, including dust and pollen down to 0.3 microns size.The double-layer cone arrangement used to make full use of the internal space,which further improves the dust and gas separation effect. ☑️【HASSLE-FREE WARRANTY】All OSOTEK cordless vacuum cleaners come with a 2-year hassle-free warranty. The warranty includes repair or parts replacement and ongoing support for your machine. If you encounter any problems after your purchase, please feel free to contact us. We will do our best to provide you with the best solution to your concern.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rJWWENaNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OSOTEK","source_asin":"B0B634YC19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B634YC19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B634YC19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
