window.products.push({"id":626818,"name":"Custom Tune Up Kit for Double Boiler Breville and Sage. IMS Precision Shower Screen, Brass Shower Holder, Silicone Gasket. Fits 900 Series BES900XL, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HIOtA4CHL._AC_SL1411_.jpg","description":"Custom Kit for 58mm Breville and Sage espresso machines BES900XL BES920XL BES980XL, BES990, Oracle, Double Boiler. IMS Precision Competition Series Shower Screen with 200 µm filtering capacity evenly distributes water flow, prevents channeling, makes every extraction consistent. Polished surface makes cleaning easier, coffee and oils doesn't stick as much as with original screen. Inner shower holder is made of brass rather than plastic original. It has much better heat retention and doesn't react with chemicals. Brass Holder has smaller holes than original holder: since machine has one spout for water pressure, original shower holder tends to concentrate more water pressure to one side of the holder. Therefore we designed shower holder with smaller holes and made more space for water to distribute more evenly towards IMS shower screen. The brass part is made from material CW510L. It conforms with the requirements for USA market with limits placed on lead for materials in contact with water for human consumption. Its NSF372 certification is a guarantee of compliance with American standards. In 2011, Federal Safe Drinking Water Act determined that “lead-free” brass has to have maximum weighted lead content of 0.25% on the wetted surface of plumbing products. The material that have been used in this kit - CW510L contains only ≤0.2 % of lead (Pb). There is also available Stainless Steel Precision Kit Compatible with Double Boiler Breville/Sage on Amazon by Verybarista. Cafelat Silicone Gasket is made with Non-toxic food grade FDA silicone. Unlike regular rubber gaskets, Silicone Gaskets do not have any smell or taste, easy to change, do not harden and always remain flexible. NEW STAINLESS STEEL SCREW. Please check installation video.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HIOtA4CHL._AC_SL1411_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"verybarista","source_asin":"B07P8JYXD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P8JYXD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P8JYXD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626819,"name":"Terramundi Money Pot - Black With White Lines - C13","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8198q9diY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Etruscan Money Amphora Terramundi money pots are hand thrown in Italy to a design  which is over 2000 years old. The British Museum holds early examples of  such \"Etruscan Money Amphora\". A Great Gift One of our best-selling lines, Terramundi earthenware money pots are really making a name for themselves across the UK. Suitable for young  and old, they are hand-painted in London in dozens of great patterns and  designs, and we are pleased to offer a wide selection. What is a Terramundi? There is no way to remove money from a Terramundi once you have put  it in. By long tradition, a Terramundi money pot must be fed until it is  full, at which time it must be smashed- releasing both your savings, and  the fortune card which comes with every pot- whilst making a wish. A pot  full of mixed silver can be expected to reward you with around 200. It is then customary to replace the pot and spend the money on 'good  things'. The broken pots can be used as holders for plants and candles,  or even as a desk tidy. We would recommend inserting the 'claw' of a  claw hammer into the money slot, and levering upwards, in order to break  off the top of the pot cleanly. Terramundi stand between 17cm and 19cm high. Every Terramundi Pot is handmade so colour/pattern may vary slightly  from the picture shown.  UNBEATABLE price during Mother's Day Madness! -->","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8198q9diY1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Terramundi Pots","source_asin":"B001252C0I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001252C0I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001252C0I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":626820,"name":"THOUSAND OAKS BARREL Personalized Crab Shack Wood Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510Z+aRAxUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Handcrafted in the USA of furniture grade wood and professionally printed using proprietary Poly-Arch Lithography Keyhole hanger on back for easy door or wall mounting. Perfect addition to any home bar, kitchen, man cave, tavern, or perhaps you’re looking for a thoughtful gift with a personalized touch! Because of our unique sign-making process, each sign has small imperfections which give it character and remind you how many hands were involved in creating this product. We've been making signs this same way for over twenty years. You won't find this hands-on approach and attention to detail from the cheaper products made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510Z+aRAxUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THOUSAND OAKS BARREL","source_asin":"B00VSXCMIG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-626820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VSXCMIG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VSXCMIG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
